      "title": "Assistant, Associate, or Full (Open Rank) Professor, Clinical PSY",
      "description": "Western Kentucky University Job Posting: Assistant, Associate, or Full (Open Rank) Professor, Clinical PSY Title Human Resources Subscribe to Email Alerts Returning Applicant Login Previous Next Assistant, Associate, or Full (Open Rank) Professor, Clinical PSY Bowling Green, KY Thank you for considering Western Kentucky University \n\t\t\t             \tin your job search. Please provide the information requested below. Contact our online Help Desk if you need assistance applying \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthrough this website. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Application Instructions: Review of applications will begin on October 12, 2026 and will continue until the position is filled. Please submit the following materials through this electronic talent management system: Cover letter describing how your experiences and interests match with the position Statement of Teaching Philosophy Current Curriculum Vita Copies of all graduate-level academic transcripts Names and contact information of three reference providers will be collected during the application process. Reference letters will be requested by the Search Committee through an online process at a later date. You will receive email confirmation once you have successfully completed the application process. For more information, please contact the search committee chair, Jeff Rutter (jeff.rutter@wku.edu). Fields marked with a * are required. Step 1: New Account Setup / Existing Account Login An employment application system account is required to apply online. Follow the instructions below to setup a new account / login to an existing account. Enter your E-mail Address and click \"Next\": * OR Existing Account Login Password: * New Account Setup - Fill out the fields below and click \"Setup New Account\". By clicking the Setup New Account button below, you confirm you have reviewed and agreed to the Global Privacy & Consent Statement . Success : Logging you in now .... please wait. Password Error : Password does not match. Please try again or click here to reset your password. Account Exists : Dear User, we noticed that you have used this employment application system in the past. To continue please enter your password in the box above. Forgot password? Please click here to reset your password. Account Deactivated : This account has been deactivated in the system. Please use a different email (Yahoo, Gmail, Hotmail, etc.) to create a new candidate account. Account Exists w/ Employer Based Email : If you are applying to this position as an internal candidate for your organization, please hide this message to continue. It is recommended that you use your non-employer email (Yahoo, Gmail, Hotmail, etc.) to create a new account. Forgot password? Please click here to reset your password. Employer Account : You have an employer account in our system with a different employer. Please use your non-employer email (Yahoo, Gmail, Hotmail, etc.) to create a new candidate account. Account Locked : Your account has been locked due to multiple unsuccessful login attempts. Please click here to reset your password. Guest Account : You have a system provided guest email and cannot login as a candidate. Step 2: Complete COREquisites™ Questionnaire Please complete [Step 1] to view. Step 3: Upload Your Resume/CV * Please complete [Step 1] to view. Step 4: Electronic Forms Please complete [Step 1] to view. Step 5: Add Your References Please complete [Step 1] to view. Step 6: Answer Optional Voluntary Demographic Information Questions Please complete [Step 1] to view. Step 7: Answer Additional Questions Please complete [Step 1] to view. Once you click Apply Now below, you will be directed to the next page to upload additional documents if requested by the employer. Hide Main Navigation Western Kentucky University 1906 College Heights Blvd. Bowling Green, KY 42101"
